OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 16, found not guilty of
OL,4,Ateenager's murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 16-year-old boy has been found not
OL,7,Fguilty of murder over the fatal
OL,8,Fstabbing of a teenager.
OL,10,FShayne Hambakachere, 16, was wounded on
OL,11,F31 January in Chippenham and died in
OL,12,FSouthmead Hospital in Bristol the
OL,13,Ffollowing day.
OL,15,FHe had gone to meet the teenager - who
OL,16,Fcannot be named due to his age - to
OL,17,Fsettle an argument over stolen
OL,18,Fcannabis. The trial was told the pair
OL,19,Fhad agreed to meet in an alleyway where
OL,20,FShayne, who was unarmed, was stabbed in
OL,21,Fthe chest.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
