OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 16, found not guilty of
OL,4,Ateenager's murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe jury at Bristol Crown Court
OL,7,Freturned the not guilty verdict after
OL,8,Fnearly 12 hours of deliberations. The
OL,9,Fboy was also found not guilty of
OL,10,Fmanslaughter.
